  "limitations": "WGS84 surface points only; decimal degrees, no altitude, datum conversion or other ellipsoids. Vincenty can fail near antipodes; this returns a structured error. Coincident bearings are null, not JSON NaN. Distance is rounded to millimetres and bearings to 7 decimals as upstream public methods do.",
  "port_notes": "Port of inverse() and the upstream public distance/bearing rounding, including the equatorial and exactly antipodal branches and 1000-iteration guard. Non-convergence becomes an error instead of upstream public-method NaN. Undefined coincident bearings become null. Longitude difference is normalized to [-180,180); physically coincident poles and equivalent antimeridian representations are explicitly detected.",
